@prefix rdf:       <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:      <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix lifecycle: <https://ofox.co.uk/lifecycle#> .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LifecycleStates.curated.ttl — curated-knowledge arm of LaSSI v4.4 (loaded
# only when LASSI_SYNONYMY=curated, on top of LifecycleStates.ttl).  Entries
# drafted 15 Oct 2026 from Police.uk, Met Office and Street Manager
# vocabularies and general knowledge, audited, and approved by Oliver; see
# Civic-Verification/02_design/curated_entries_draft.md (IDs in brackets).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

